{
  "entry": "dlg_morrel_toast_open",
  "id": "dlg_morrel_toast",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "choices": [
        {
          "goto": "dlg_morrel_toast_aside",
          "id": "dlg_morrel_toast_more",
          "text": "Let them talk. People say more to a listener than to a question."
        },
        {
          "goto": "dlg_morrel_toast_out",
          "id": "dlg_morrel_toast_leave",
          "text": "Nod, and keep your own counsel."
        }
      ],
      "id": "dlg_morrel_toast_open",
      "text": "Why, I lived almost on the same floor with the poor old man. Ah, yes, about a year after the disappearance of his son the poor old man died."
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_morrel_toast_aside",
      "next": "dlg_morrel_toast_out",
      "text": "Why, the doctors called his complaint gastro-enteritis, I believe; his acquaintances say he died of grief; but I, who saw him in his dying moments, I say he died of——"
    },
    {
      "id": "dlg_morrel_toast_out",
      "isEnd": true,
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "flag": "active_dialogue__npc_morrel",
          "type": "set_flag",
          "value": false
        }
      ],
      "text": "Captain Gaumard, recovered from his illness, had returned from Palma."
    }
  ],
